            "text": "Normalize release records at the input boundary.\n\nImport direction: this module imports nothing from the other three modules; it\nis the identity/replay layer that planner.py consumes. The specific failure\ncode travels in the exception message because planner.py maps ``str(exc)``\nstraight into the transport result."
