            "kind": "comment",
            "start": 60,
            "end": 60,
            "text": "# reverse order. Budget was validated but never caps rollback."
          },
          {
            "kind": "comment",
            "start": 66,
            "end": 66,
            "text": "# Plan: replay first (applied entries satisfy dependencies and spend no new"
          },
          {
            "kind": "comment",
            "start": 67,
            "end": 67,
            "text": "# budget), then the G2 staging quota on the emitted units. The quota is"
          },
          {
            "kind": "comment",
            "start": 68,
            "end": 68,
            "text": "# checked before emitting anything, so a rejected plan has no partial actions."
          }
