            "text": "JSON transport for the release planner.\n\nThis file is the only place that touches stdin/stdout and the only place that\nturns a malformed payload into invalid-json. It writes no files, contacts no\nservice and never executes a deployment; everything else is delegated to\nplanner.plan (which pulls in policy and journal)."
