            "text": "# in this environment would also land here with the same code."
          },
          {
            "kind": "comment",
            "start": 32,
            "end": 32,
            "text": "# Integers exclude booleans; `type(...) is int` rejects True/False as budgets."
          },
          {
            "kind": "comment",
            "start": 35,
