            "kind": "docstring",
            "start": 9,
            "end": 14,
            "text": "Validate a JSON array of nonempty change IDs.\n\n    `depends_on`, `applied` and `retain` share this shape. A bare string, an\n    object, a number or a null is a malformed field, not an empty one; and the\n    empty string does not name a change, so it is malformed too."
