            "kind": "docstring",
            "start": 57,
            "end": 63,
            "text": "Read the G2 rollback `retain` list: applied IDs that must remain installed.\n\n    `retain` defaults to empty. Malformed lists are rejected here; an ID that is\n    a valid string but was never applied is rejected here too, because that needs\n    the persisted journal and no other module is allowed to own it. Repeated IDs\n    are harmless; the value is consumed as a set."
